[120.41781, "o", "{\"type\":\"assistant\",\"message\":{\"model\":\"claude-sonnet-4-6\",\"id\":\"msg_014kPmjn59Z6Xvqrsjj2ELst\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"thinking\",\"thinking\":\"Now I understand the structure. Let me now determine exactly what tests are missing based on the assignments:\\n\\nLooking at the existing test files:\\n\\n**BiBestFirstFinder** - Missing start==end test (assignment #8):\\nLooking at BiBestFirstFinder.test.js - no start==end test.\\n\\n**IDAStarFinder** - Missing start==end (assignment #9):\\nLooking at IDAStarFinder.js - no start==end test in that file. There's one in Util.js (from the test run output \\\"IDA* should handle start==end gracefully\\\") but that's in a different scenario/Util test.\\n\\n\\n**BiDijkstraFinder** needs an explicit end-side expansion test similar to what BiAStarFinder has, since the current \\\"path is contiguous\\\" test doesn't clearly demonstrate that behavior. **BiAStarFinder** is missing a test case that exercises the endOpenList.updateItem branch.\\n\\n**IDAStarFinder** lacks "]
